{
 "id": 382645,
 "name": "Part 2.1: Update Salesforce Case Priority by Case ID with Slack Workbot",
 "description": "1. Type or paste a **Salesforce Case URL** in the Workbot DM or in a channel Workbot is in.\n2. Workbot will automatically reply with a message showing more information about that particular Case. \n3. Workbot will prompt you with 3 buttons to update, delete or close the case. This recipe allows you to update the Case Priority after clicking on the update button.\n\n**Notes**\n- This recipe works together with the [Slack Workbot shows Salesforce Case details when you post a URL in Slack](https://www.workato.com/recipes/382647-slack-workbot-shows-salesforce-case-details-when-you-post-a-url-in-slack) recipe. To use this recipe, copy and run both recipes.\n- Workbot must be invited to Slack channels before it can post messages in those channels.",
